# BookClub client — copy to `.env.development.local` or `.env.production.local` (gitignored).
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_.

# --- API (axios baseURL) ---
# Default: `/api` (relative). Dev: Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:3000 (see vite.config.ts).
# Use a full URL only if the browser origin is NOT the same as the API (e.g. SPA on CDN, API on college server):
# VITE_API_URL=https://node75.cs.colman.ac.il/api

# --- Static uploads (/uploads/posts, /uploads/profiles) ---
# If the app is served from the same host as Express, you usually do NOT need this (assetUrl uses window.location.origin in prod).
# Set if images are on another origin:
# VITE_ASSET_ORIGIN=https://node75.cs.colman.ac.il
